'''Toxic Vines''' is an debuff that is cast during a Foul [[Ritual]].

This debuff applies a movement impairing affect any time the player is stationary and stacks up to a max of ten times. 

In order to remove the debuff, the player must move around for how many stacks of Toxic Vines that still persist.

